@v146 kernel.seq.make item "76" item "3 days" item "Wednesday" item "budget"
@v147 kernel.seq.make
@v148 kernel.value.record "answer" "**Status.** Project Atlas is approximately 76% complete, and basic functional testing passed. The budget remains unchanged.\n\n**Main risk.** The equipment delivery is 3 days late and may affect the demonstration date.\n\n**Decision.** The team is continuing work that does not depend on the equipment and is not changing the overall plan for now.\n\n**Next step.** A new checkpoint will take place on Wednesday at 11:00. If the equipment has not arrived by then, the manager will decide whether the demonstration should be rescheduled." "requiredConcepts" $v146 "forbiddenClaims" $v147
@v149 kernel.value.record "method" "template-assisted" "reviewed" true "note" ""
@v150 kernel.seq.make item "core-only"
@v151 kernel.seq.make item "assigned-train-visible" item "source-category:structured-summarization" item "domain:work" item "length:medium"
