@v153 kernel.value.record "format" "eslm-basic-everyday-eval-case" "id" "everyday-0017" "source" $v145 "pool" "source-development" "category" "structured-summarization" "difficulty" "medium" "scoring" "semantic" "prompt" "Turn the notes into a summary of no more than 180 words, divided into: status, main risk, decision, and next step. Do not invent information.\n\nProject Atlas is approximately 76% complete. Basic functional testing passed, but an equipment delivery is 3 days late. The budget has not changed. The team decided to continue work that does not depend on the equipment. A new checkpoint will take place on Wednesday at 11:00. If the equipment has not arrived by then, the manager will decide whether to move the demonstration date." "reference" $v148 "conversion" $v149 "profiles" $v150 "tags" $v151 "constraints" $v152 "reviewNotes" "Source policy: development-visible"
