@v749 kernel.seq.make item "1050" item "30 minutes" item "8 people" item "two hours"
@v750 kernel.seq.make
@v751 kernel.value.record "answer" "I would divide the two hours as follows:\n\n**First 20 minutes:** check what you already have, choose a simple menu, and make the final list. Keep the total budget below 1050 lei, but do not invent prices.\n\n**Next 70 minutes:** prepare items that can remain ready until the guests arrive: a simple appetizer, an easy main dish, and drinks. Tidy the kitchen at the same time.\n\n**Final 30 minutes:** stop cooking. Set the table, put out glasses and cutlery, check the entrance area, and leave a few minutes for yourself.\n\nThe plan follows the main constraint: the final 30 minutes contain no cooking or complicated tasks." "requiredConcepts" $v749 "forbiddenClaims" $v750
@v752 kernel.value.record "method" "template-assisted" "reviewed" true "note" ""
@v753 kernel.seq.make item "core-only"
