@v929 kernel.seq.make item "84" item "3 days" item "Tuesday" item "budget"
@v930 kernel.seq.make
@v931 kernel.value.record "answer" "**Status.** Project Atlas is approximately 84% complete, and basic functional testing passed. The budget remains unchanged.\n\n**Main risk.** The equipment delivery is 3 days late and may affect the demonstration date.\n\n**Decision.** The team is continuing work that does not depend on the equipment and is not changing the overall plan for now.\n\n**Next step.** A new checkpoint will take place on Tuesday at 11:00. If the equipment has not arrived by then, the manager will decide whether the demonstration should be rescheduled." "requiredConcepts" $v929 "forbiddenClaims" $v930
@v932 kernel.value.record "method" "template-assisted" "reviewed" true "note" ""
@v933 kernel.seq.make item "core-only"
