@v2063 kernel.seq.make item "Option A" item "effort" item "440" item "285"
@v2064 kernel.seq.make
@v2065 kernel.value.record "answer" "Under the stated criterion—reducing organizational effort—**Option A is more suitable**. It includes the room, lunch, and equipment, eliminating logistical activities that would need separate management under Option B. Its disadvantages are the 40-minute trip and the higher cost of 440 lei per person.\n\nOption B is less expensive at 285 lei per person and requires no travel. However, the team must organize lunch and materials, and the request says effort matters more than cost.\n\nI would choose Option A if the travel is acceptable. I would not calculate additional savings for B because no lunch or material costs were provided." "requiredConcepts" $v2063 "forbiddenClaims" $v2064
@v2066 kernel.value.record "method" "template-assisted" "reviewed" true "note" "The Romanian option labels were localized to English."
@v2067 kernel.seq.make item "core-only"
@v2068 kernel.seq.make item "assigned-train-visible" item "source-category:option-comparison" item "domain:decision-making" item "length:medium"
@v2069 kernel.value.record "expectedMinWords" 102 "expectedMaxWords" 230 "acceptableVariations" "A different recommendation is accepted only if it is justified strictly by the supplied criteria and invents no costs."
@v2070 kernel.value.record "format" "eslm-basic-everyday-eval-case" "id" "everyday-0230" "source" $v2062 "pool" "source-development" "category" "option-comparison" "difficulty" "medium" "scoring" "semantic" "prompt" "I need to choose between two options for a one-day internal workshop. Option A costs 440 lei per person and includes the room, lunch, and equipment, but requires 40 minutes of travel. Option B costs 285 lei per person, is at the office, and requires no travel, but the team must organize lunch and materials separately. There are 12 participants, and reducing organizational effort matters more to us than cost.\n\nCompare the options in 120–220 words and recommend exactly one. Do not invent other costs." "reference" $v2065 "conversion" $v2066 "profiles" $v2067 "tags" $v2068 "constraints" $v2069 "reviewNotes" "Source policy: development-visible"
@v2071 kernel.value.record "collection" "eslm-everyday-source.jsonl" "locator" "dataset.jsonl:231" "sourceId" "RO-024-01" "sourceDigest" "sha256:857cf83d618585aeab9f2b6fe8afc03e6af4d13f7cd435aa9db477b154dbe064" "sourceFile" "cases/benchmark_024.md"
