@v2333 kernel.seq.make item "800" item "30 minutes" item "8 people" item "two hours"
@v2334 kernel.seq.make
@v2335 kernel.value.record "answer" "I would divide the two hours as follows:\n\n**First 20 minutes:** check what you already have, choose a simple menu, and make the final list. Keep the total budget below 800 lei, but do not invent prices.\n\n**Next 70 minutes:** prepare items that can remain ready until the guests arrive: a simple appetizer, an easy main dish, and drinks. Tidy the kitchen at the same time.\n\n**Final 30 minutes:** stop cooking. Set the table, put out glasses and cutlery, check the entrance area, and leave a few minutes for yourself.\n\nThe plan follows the main constraint: the final 30 minutes contain no cooking or complicated tasks." "requiredConcepts" $v2333 "forbiddenClaims" $v2334
@v2336 kernel.value.record "method" "template-assisted" "reviewed" true "note" ""
@v2337 kernel.seq.make item "core-only"
@v2338 kernel.seq.make item "assigned-train-visible" item "source-category:practical-plan" item "domain:everyday-life" item "length:medium"
@v2339 kernel.value.record "expectedMinWords" 95 "expectedMaxWords" 230 "acceptableVariations" "The menu may vary; the time constraint and prohibition on invented prices must be preserved."
@v2340 kernel.value.record "format" "eslm-basic-everyday-eval-case" "id" "everyday-0260" "source" $v2332 "pool" "source-development" "category" "practical-plan" "difficulty" "medium" "scoring" "semantic" "prompt" "I want to organize a small gathering at home for eight people. The maximum budget is 800 lei. I do not want a sophisticated menu. I have two hours to prepare, and during the final half hour I want to stop cooking and only set the table and get ready.\n\nPropose a practical plan in stages. Do not give exact product prices because I did not provide local prices. Maximum 220 words." "reference" $v2335 "conversion" $v2336 "profiles" $v2337 "tags" $v2338 "constraints" $v2339 "reviewNotes" "Source policy: development-visible"
