@v2654 kernel.value.record "expectedMinWords" 100 "expectedMaxWords" 260 "acceptableVariations" "Daily content may vary; the number of days, time limit, review period, and final test are required."
@v2655 kernel.value.record "format" "eslm-basic-everyday-eval-case" "id" "everyday-0295" "source" $v2647 "pool" "source-development" "category" "study-plan" "difficulty" "medium" "scoring" "semantic" "prompt" "I want a simple study plan for academic writing. I have 6 days, with 45 minutes per day. I am a beginner and do not want to cover too much. Each day must have one main objective, one practical activity, and five minutes of review. On the final day I want a short self-assessment test.\n\nMake a short, concrete plan of no more than 250 words." "reference" $v2650 "conversion" $v2651 "profiles" $v2652 "tags" $v2653 "constraints" $v2654 "reviewNotes" "Source policy: development-visible"
