@v2801 kernel.seq.make item "900" item "30 minutes" item "8 people" item "two hours"
@v2802 kernel.seq.make
@v2803 kernel.value.record "answer" "I would divide the two hours as follows:\n\n**First 20 minutes:** check what you already have, choose a simple menu, and make the final list. Keep the total budget below 900 lei, but do not invent prices.\n\n**Next 70 minutes:** prepare items that can remain ready until the guests arrive: a simple appetizer, an easy main dish, and drinks. Tidy the kitchen at the same time.\n\n**Final 30 minutes:** stop cooking. Set the table, put out glasses and cutlery, check the entrance area, and leave a few minutes for yourself.\n\nThe plan follows the main constraint: the final 30 minutes contain no cooking or complicated tasks." "requiredConcepts" $v2801 "forbiddenClaims" $v2802
@v2804 kernel.value.record "method" "template-assisted" "reviewed" true "note" ""
@v2805 kernel.seq.make item "core-only"
@v2806 kernel.seq.make item "assigned-train-visible" item "source-category:practical-plan" item "domain:everyday-life" item "length:medium"
@v2807 kernel.value.record "expectedMinWords" 95 "expectedMaxWords" 230 "acceptableVariations" "The menu may vary; the time constraint and prohibition on invented prices must be preserved."
@v2808 kernel.value.record "format" "eslm-basic-everyday-eval-case" "id" "everyday-0312" "source" $v2800 "pool" "source-development" "category" "practical-plan" "difficulty" "medium" "scoring" "semantic" "prompt" "I want to organize a small gathering at home for eight people. The maximum budget is 900 lei. I do not want a sophisticated menu. I have two hours to prepare, and during the final half hour I want to stop cooking and only set the table and get ready.\n\nPropose a practical plan in stages. Do not give exact product prices because I did not provide local prices. Maximum 220 words." "reference" $v2803 "conversion" $v2804 "profiles" $v2805 "tags" $v2806 "constraints" $v2807 "reviewNotes" "Source policy: development-visible"
@v2809 kernel.value.record "collection" "eslm-everyday-source.jsonl" "locator" "dataset.jsonl:313" "sourceId" "RO-032-03" "sourceDigest" "sha256:68219e700ade92923779785243ec52c1c146c7ead6ca53e6f8b6fd67e487670d" "sourceFile" "cases/benchmark_032.md"
