@v3125 kernel.seq.make item "80" item "1 day" item "Friday" item "budget"
@v3126 kernel.seq.make
@v3127 kernel.value.record "answer" "**Status.** Project Atlas is approximately 80% complete, and basic functional testing passed. The budget remains unchanged.\n\n**Main risk.** The equipment delivery is 1 day late and may affect the demonstration date.\n\n**Decision.** The team is continuing work that does not depend on the equipment and is not changing the overall plan for now.\n\n**Next step.** A new checkpoint will take place on Friday at 11:00. If the equipment has not arrived by then, the manager will decide whether the demonstration should be rescheduled." "requiredConcepts" $v3125 "forbiddenClaims" $v3126
@v3128 kernel.value.record "method" "template-assisted" "reviewed" true "note" "Romanian number agreement was normalized in English."
@v3129 kernel.seq.make item "core-only"
@v3130 kernel.seq.make item "assigned-train-visible" item "source-category:structured-summarization" item "domain:work" item "length:medium"
@v3131 kernel.value.record "expectedMinWords" 78 "expectedMaxWords" 180 "acceptableVariations" "Wording may vary, but the four sections and facts must be preserved."
@v3132 kernel.value.record "format" "eslm-basic-everyday-eval-case" "id" "everyday-0348" "source" $v3124 "pool" "source-development" "category" "structured-summarization" "difficulty" "medium" "scoring" "semantic" "prompt" "Turn the notes into a summary of no more than 180 words, divided into: status, main risk, decision, and next step. Do not invent information.\n\nProject Atlas is approximately 80% complete. Basic functional testing passed, but an equipment delivery is 1 day late. The budget has not changed. The team decided to continue work that does not depend on the equipment. A new checkpoint will take place on Friday at 11:00. If the equipment has not arrived by then, the manager will decide whether to move the demonstration date." "reference" $v3127 "conversion" $v3128 "profiles" $v3129 "tags" $v3130 "constraints" $v3131 "reviewNotes" "Source policy: development-visible"
@v3133 kernel.value.record "collection" "eslm-everyday-source.jsonl" "locator" "dataset.jsonl:349" "sourceId" "RO-035-09" "sourceDigest" "sha256:2e405954ae450dea82b3ce00da4d7a653de92a3296fb98c94bea4a96f04ead2d" "sourceFile" "cases/benchmark_035.md"
