@v3260 kernel.seq.make item "82" item "2 days" item "Monday" item "budget"
@v3261 kernel.seq.make
@v3262 kernel.value.record "answer" "**Status.** Project Atlas is approximately 82% complete, and basic functional testing passed. The budget remains unchanged.\n\n**Main risk.** The equipment delivery is 2 days late and may affect the demonstration date.\n\n**Decision.** The team is continuing work that does not depend on the equipment and is not changing the overall plan for now.\n\n**Next step.** A new checkpoint will take place on Monday at 11:00. If the equipment has not arrived by then, the manager will decide whether the demonstration should be rescheduled." "requiredConcepts" $v3260 "forbiddenClaims" $v3261
@v3263 kernel.value.record "method" "template-assisted" "reviewed" true "note" ""
@v3264 kernel.seq.make item "core-only"
@v3265 kernel.seq.make item "assigned-train-visible" item "source-category:structured-summarization" item "domain:work" item "length:medium"
@v3266 kernel.value.record "expectedMinWords" 78 "expectedMaxWords" 180 "acceptableVariations" "Wording may vary, but the four sections and facts must be preserved."
