@v3469 kernel.value.record "answer" "**Status.** Project Atlas is approximately 78% complete, and basic functional testing passed. The budget remains unchanged.\n\n**Main risk.** The equipment delivery is 4 days late and may affect the demonstration date.\n\n**Decision.** The team is continuing work that does not depend on the equipment and is not changing the overall plan for now.\n\n**Next step.** A new checkpoint will take place on Thursday at 11:00. If the equipment has not arrived by then, the manager will decide whether the demonstration should be rescheduled." "requiredConcepts" $v3467 "forbiddenClaims" $v3468
