@v4176 kernel.value.record "format" "eslm-basic-everyday-eval-case" "id" "everyday-0464" "source" $v4168 "pool" "source-development" "category" "study-plan" "difficulty" "medium" "scoring" "semantic" "prompt" "I want a simple study plan for geography. I have 6 days, with 45 minutes per day. I am a beginner and do not want to cover too much. Each day must have one main objective, one practical activity, and five minutes of review. On the final day I want a short self-assessment test.\n\nMake a short, concrete plan of no more than 250 words." "reference" $v4171 "conversion" $v4172 "profiles" $v4173 "tags" $v4174 "constraints" $v4175 "reviewNotes" "Source policy: development-visible"
