@v5033 kernel.seq.make item "90" item "2 days" item "Friday" item "budget"
@v5034 kernel.seq.make
@v5035 kernel.value.record "answer" "**Status.** Project Atlas is approximately 90% complete, and basic functional testing passed. The budget remains unchanged.\n\n**Main risk.** The equipment delivery is 2 days late and may affect the demonstration date.\n\n**Decision.** The team is continuing work that does not depend on the equipment and is not changing the overall plan for now.\n\n**Next step.** A new checkpoint will take place on Friday at 11:00. If the equipment has not arrived by then, the manager will decide whether the demonstration should be rescheduled." "requiredConcepts" $v5033 "forbiddenClaims" $v5034
@v5036 kernel.value.record "method" "template-assisted" "reviewed" true "note" ""
@v5037 kernel.seq.make item "core-only"
@v5038 kernel.seq.make item "assigned-train-visible" item "source-category:structured-summarization" item "domain:work" item "length:medium"
@v5039 kernel.value.record "expectedMinWords" 78 "expectedMaxWords" 180 "acceptableVariations" "Wording may vary, but the four sections and facts must be preserved."
@v5040 kernel.value.record "format" "eslm-basic-everyday-eval-case" "id" "everyday-0560" "source" $v5032 "pool" "source-development" "category" "structured-summarization" "difficulty" "medium" "scoring" "semantic" "prompt" "Turn the notes into a summary of no more than 180 words, divided into: status, main risk, decision, and next step. Do not invent information.\n\nProject Atlas is approximately 90% complete. Basic functional testing passed, but an equipment delivery is 2 days late. The budget has not changed. The team decided to continue work that does not depend on the equipment. A new checkpoint will take place on Friday at 11:00. If the equipment has not arrived by then, the manager will decide whether to move the demonstration date." "reference" $v5035 "conversion" $v5036 "profiles" $v5037 "tags" $v5038 "constraints" $v5039 "reviewNotes" "Source policy: development-visible"
