@v5107 kernel.value.record "answer" "The main problem is that **authority in one field does not guarantee correctness in every field**. The premise may be relevant, but it is not sufficient for the stated general conclusion.\n\nTo make the argument stronger, add evidence that directly links the premise to the conclusion: more representative observations, relevant comparisons, tests, or information about the causal mechanism, as appropriate. State the conclusion in proportion to the strength of the evidence rather than extending it beyond that evidence." "requiredConcepts" $v5105 "forbiddenClaims" $v5106
