@v6617 kernel.seq.make item "Friday" item "two errors" item "figures"
@v6618 kernel.seq.make
@v6619 kernel.value.record "answer" "Hello,\n\nI noticed that the file has not been sent yet. Please finish it and send it to me by Friday. Before sending it, check the figures once more because the previous version still contained two errors.\n\nWhen the final version is ready, send me the file directly. If anything prevents you from meeting the deadline, let me know as soon as possible.\n\nThank you." "requiredConcepts" $v6617 "forbiddenClaims" $v6618
