@v7148 kernel.seq.make item "Thursday" item "two errors" item "figures"
@v7149 kernel.seq.make
@v7150 kernel.value.record "answer" "Hello,\n\nI noticed that the file has not been sent yet. Please finish it and send it to me by Thursday. Before sending it, check the figures once more because the previous version still contained two errors.\n\nWhen the final version is ready, send me the file directly. If anything prevents you from meeting the deadline, let me know as soon as possible.\n\nThank you." "requiredConcepts" $v7148 "forbiddenClaims" $v7149
@v7151 kernel.value.record "method" "template-assisted" "reviewed" true "note" "The reference is translated faithfully even though its length may not satisfy the source’s stated 90-word minimum."
