@v7841 kernel.seq.make item "950" item "30 minutes" item "8 people" item "two hours"
@v7842 kernel.seq.make
@v7843 kernel.value.record "answer" "I would divide the two hours as follows:\n\n**First 20 minutes:** check what you already have, choose a simple menu, and make the final list. Keep the total budget below 950 lei, but do not invent prices.\n\n**Next 70 minutes:** prepare items that can remain ready until the guests arrive: a simple appetizer, an easy main dish, and drinks. Tidy the kitchen at the same time.\n\n**Final 30 minutes:** stop cooking. Set the table, put out glasses and cutlery, check the entrance area, and leave a few minutes for yourself.\n\nThe plan follows the main constraint: the final 30 minutes contain no cooking or complicated tasks." "requiredConcepts" $v7841 "forbiddenClaims" $v7842
@v7844 kernel.value.record "method" "template-assisted" "reviewed" true "note" ""
@v7845 kernel.seq.make item "core-only"
@v7846 kernel.seq.make item "assigned-train-visible" item "source-category:practical-plan" item "domain:everyday-life" item "length:medium"
@v7847 kernel.value.record "expectedMinWords" 95 "expectedMaxWords" 230 "acceptableVariations" "The menu may vary; the time constraint and prohibition on invented prices must be preserved."
@v7848 kernel.value.record "format" "eslm-basic-everyday-eval-case" "id" "everyday-0872" "source" $v7840 "pool" "source-development" "category" "practical-plan" "difficulty" "medium" "scoring" "semantic" "prompt" "I want to organize a small gathering at home for eight people. The maximum budget is 950 lei. I do not want a sophisticated menu. I have two hours to prepare, and during the final half hour I want to stop cooking and only set the table and get ready.\n\nPropose a practical plan in stages. Do not give exact product prices because I did not provide local prices. Maximum 220 words." "reference" $v7843 "conversion" $v7844 "profiles" $v7845 "tags" $v7846 "constraints" $v7847 "reviewNotes" "Source policy: development-visible"
@v7849 kernel.value.record "collection" "eslm-everyday-source.jsonl" "locator" "dataset.jsonl:873" "sourceId" "RO-088-03" "sourceDigest" "sha256:557a95c23cea43b35fe40a708be22b0d96d38797ae45e0409371e10272d5de41" "sourceFile" "cases/benchmark_088.md"
