@v7967 kernel.seq.make
@v7968 kernel.seq.make
@v7969 kernel.value.record "answer" "The essential difference is this: a symptom is a manifestation, while a diagnosis identifies a condition based on an evaluation.\n\nA simple example should show that the terms may be related but answer different questions. They should therefore not be used as synonyms, and neither should be inferred automatically from the other without enough information.\n\n**In short:** the two concepts concern a similar subject but describe different properties or roles; a correct explanation begins by separating those roles clearly." "requiredConcepts" $v7967 "forbiddenClaims" $v7968
