@v8334 kernel.value.record "format" "eslm-basic-everyday-eval-case" "id" "everyday-0926" "source" $v8326 "pool" "source-development" "category" "complex-everyday-task" "difficulty" "medium-hard" "scoring" "semantic" "prompt" "I want a template for a three-day trip with four friends. We have a car and want one day in nature, one day in a city, and one very relaxed half-day. One of us tires easily when walking, and we do not want difficult trails. We want at least two free hours every day. We leave Friday morning and return Sunday evening.\n\nBuild a generic itinerary using approximate time blocks and include a rainy-day backup for the nature day. Do not invent a specific city or destination. Maximum 700 words." "reference" $v8329 "conversion" $v8330 "profiles" $v8331 "tags" $v8332 "constraints" $v8333 "reviewNotes" "Source policy: development-visible"
